  {
    "id": 1014003090010,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お疲れ様会ありがとー、プロデューサーさん☆",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "charType": "characters",
    "charId": "014",
    "charPosition": {
      "x": 568,
      "y": 640,
      "order": 0
    },
    "charEffect": {
      "type": "from",
      "alpha": 0,
      "time": 100
    },
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090010"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "ああいや、これぐらいしかできなくて悪いな\r\n──改めて、お疲れ様だ、甘奈",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "甜花にも千雪にも恥じない頑張りだったと、\r\n俺は思ってるよ",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090020,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090020"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090030,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……──ねぇプロデューサーさん、聞いてくれる？",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090030"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "うん……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090040,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "甘奈の初恋ね、幼稚園の頃だったの",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090040"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "お、おう──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090050,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "一緒に遊んだりとかは、あんまりしなかったんだけど",
    "charAnim1": "wait1",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090050"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090060,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "お当番があると、すっと甘奈を手伝ってくれたりとか\r\nお昼寝の時に、ちょっと目が合ったら笑い合ったりとか",
    "charAnim1": "shy1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090060"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090070,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そういう、ハッキリお友達ってわけじゃないけど、\r\n仲がいい子だった",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090070"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090080,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "その子から、『甘奈ちゃんが好き』って言われて、甘奈──\r\nなんて返したと思う？",
    "charAnim1": "surp2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090080"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "え、ええ……？\r\n『甘奈も！』とかか……？",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090090,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ぶっぶー、ハズレー",
    "charAnim1": "anger3",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090090"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090100,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "正解は\r\n『甘奈の一番は甜花ちゃんだから、ごめんなさい』",
    "charAnim1": "sad2",
    "charAnim2": "face_wait",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090100"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "な、なるほど……その頃から……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090110,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "ふふっ、うん\r\n──そしたらね、その子が",
    "charAnim1": "wait2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090110"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090120,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "『そういう甘奈ちゃんが好きだから、大丈夫！』\r\nってすっごくにっこり笑ってくれたの",
    "charAnim1": "wait4",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090120"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090130,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "その時に、すとーんって",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charAnim3": "yes",
    "charAnim3Loop": false,
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090130"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……好きになった？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090140,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "そう！",
    "charAnim1": "smile2",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090140"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090150,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "一回ごめんなさいって言ってるのに、\r\nいっきに好きになっちゃった",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090150"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090160,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……──そのままの甘奈を\r\n認めてくれた人だからなのかな、って……",
    "charAnim1": "shy2",
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090160"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "……どうして、教えてくれたんだ？",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090170,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "え……？",
    "charAnim1": "wait3",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_surp2",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090170"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "だって、大事な思い出だろ？\r\n俺なんかに話してくれた理由は──",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090180,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "……──ふふふ",
    "charAnim1": "sad1",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090180"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090190,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "プロデューサーさんはやっぱりずるいなぁ\r\nそんなの、決まってるのに",
    "charAnim2": "face_smile2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_shy",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090190"
  },
  {
    "speaker": "プロデューサー",
    "text": "えっ、すまん……！？\r\n思い当たる節がなくて……！",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "002"
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090200,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "あーん、こういう時ばっかり察しが悪い！\r\nちゃんと教えるから、ちゃんと考えてね？",
    "charAnim1": "anger2",
    "charAnim2": "face_sad",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textCtrl": "p",
    "textFrame": "001",
    "voice": "produce_events/101400309/1014003090200"
  },
  {
    "charAnim2": "face_close2",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile_s",
    "charLabel": "amana",
    "textFrame": "off",
    "waitType": "time",
    "waitTime": 1000
  },
  {
    "id": 1014003090210,
    "speaker": "甘奈",
    "text": "──甘奈のこと、知ってほしかったからだよ☆",
    "charAnim1": "hello",
    "charAnim2": "blank",
    "charLipAnim": "lip_smile",
    "charLabel": "amana",
